<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-Y6-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-Y6-004" ;
  triage:title "NonClaudeHarnessNewMessageState enum missing from delivery_policy.rs" ;
  triage:description "docs/phase-Y/delivery-state-machines.md §1 specifies the required NonClaudeHarnessNewMessageState enum with states: Received, PersistSqlite, SqliteCommitted, DeliverOriginal, DeliverErrorMessage, RunPrimaryNudge, RunErrorNudge, Delivered, Failed. The implementation defines ClaudeHarnessNewMessageState but the corresponding non-Claude machine enum is absent from delivery_policy.rs. The delivery-state-machines.md §Required QA Artifacts section requires this enum. Fix: add NonClaudeHarnessNewMessageState to delivery_policy.rs with all required states; apply #[expect(dead_code, reason = ...)] if not all transitions are yet exercised." ;
